ion: the real panel shows the two stored revisions.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A person chose a version in the History panel of a View, as a member who holds history.read; the panel compares that View with the version before it.","The base state compares an autosave with its parent: one changed resource, the View, whose diff opens at once. The Variants show the other compare targets, a first version, no differences, an Asset image change, loading and failure.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the column is the panel content, about 340px wide in the Workbench."],"intent":"Show a comparison in the View page History panel as built from Adapter Widgets only: the two compared versions, the compare-with choices, the summary of the changed resources and, per resource, the semantic diff the server computed, with Restore this version and the canvas mode choice.","interactionRules":["A version can be compared with its previous version or with the current state; the summary lists each changed resource with its status, and a resource opens its semantic diff.","The diff of a View lists name and feature changes, Widgets added, removed, moved or changed in config, Variants and their State overrides, and Spec items; every value is shown as written and is never translated.","An Asset change shows its image before and after beside the content digest change.","Restore this version is offered on desktop to a holder of history.restore and the resource write key; the canvas before and after choice is offered on tablet and desktop.","Closing the comparison returns to the timeline."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the four core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"a4c1d701-